<title>USA: Midlothian, Texas, won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Midlothian, Texas, won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc. said it won $3.200 million of Midlothian, Texas, combination tax and revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1996 with a net interest cost of 5.2119 percent.</p>
</text>
